#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:4 0306feb744474da89fe302f189add995
msgid "上传和管理个人文件"
msgstr "Upload and Manage Personal Files"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:7 e44081d948c74d7b94adf19c9f63cff5
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:9 9c2c46b1abb1497ebe3c3738d7844fe5
msgid "帮助用户完成文件上传和个人目录管理的基础操作。"
msgstr "Help users complete basic file upload and personal directory management operations."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:12 b41be4323e104c96890d15be3db17b5d
msgid "进入方式"
msgstr "How to Access"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:14 c03d16d445ae4a4795893ea7f75d0fc8
msgid "点击左侧菜单 ``文件管理``，进入个人文件页面。"
msgstr "Click ``File Management`` in the left menu to open the personal files page."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:17 f9dd1d04b4db4798bbab32d6ed699d0a
msgid "页面内容"
msgstr "Page Overview"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:19 4f5b54c505bd4bdca6cad925f6a65382
msgid ""
"页面顶部显示当前路径 ``scorr/``；下方是工具栏，包含 ``返回上一级`` ``新建文件夹`` ``上传文件`` 按钮和 ``搜索文件``"
" 输入框。"
msgstr ""
"The current path ``scorr/`` is shown at the top. Below is a toolbar with ``Go Up``, ``New Folder``, and ``Upload File`` buttons, plus a ``Search Files`` input box."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:22 4ade4e5acb5d4238be2d150e843460c5
msgid ""
"主体是文件列表表格，列包含 ``文件名``、``文件大小``、``上次修改时间``、 ``操作``。每个文件行最右侧 ``操作`` 列有一个红色 "
"``×`` 按钮用于删除。"
msgstr ""
"The main area is a file list table with columns ``File Name``, ``File Size``, ``Last Modified``, and ``Actions``. Each row has a red ``×`` button in the ``Actions`` column for deletion."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:29 e269a7ff546344c9b3ea66fd16c11597
msgid "文件管理页面"
msgstr "File management page"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:29 ba7d979fe0664972803ee64e72305ed9
msgid "文件管理页面，显示当前用户个人目录的文件列表。"
msgstr "File management page showing the file list in the current user's personal directory."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:32 4e391fd6f1d34d408658ed290ba73fc9
msgid "上传文件流程"
msgstr "Upload File Workflow"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:34 add0ea955ee246abbecd1bd5642df12c
msgid "在 ``文件管理`` 页面点击 ``上传文件`` 按钮。"
msgstr "On the ``File Management`` page, click ``Upload File``."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:35 92a41dc7fec5471fbf98194a1f49f5a6
msgid "在弹出的对话框中选择本地文件，确认上传。"
msgstr "In the dialog, select a local file and confirm the upload."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:36 2a2ac0ec549b4148af3407ddd2ff9084
msgid "上传完成后，文件出现在列表中。"
msgstr "After the upload completes, the file appears in the list."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:42 772a678fa13e4ef9a21e5c3c96b09925
msgid "文件上传对话框"
msgstr "File upload dialog"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:42 430f08d6c9df413a9f4edb725d979724
msgid "点击 ``上传文件`` 后弹出的上传对话框。"
msgstr "Upload dialog shown after clicking ``Upload File``."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:45 40b63cc0a1144590b48a86e4a249b291
msgid "新建文件夹流程"
msgstr "Create Folder Workflow"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:47 54a509028e31404b9649c33ff00a53bb
msgid "在 ``文件管理`` 页面点击 ``新建文件夹`` 按钮。"
msgstr "On the ``File Management`` page, click ``New Folder``."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:48 15aaea70c7bd429a9bb95c1455d394bb
msgid "在弹出的对话框中输入文件夹名称。"
msgstr "Enter the folder name in the dialog."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:49 2b66e9cf16ef4d7999e1a8e76f10a2a2
msgid "确认后，新文件夹出现在文件列表中。"
msgstr "After confirmation, the new folder appears in the file list."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:52 76abaf3825ed4d8bb25cf0c51feb76f8
msgid "删除文件流程"
msgstr "Delete File Workflow"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:56 f22b3e8d3645498e9236661eb2632631
msgid ""
"删除操作不可恢复，请在删除前确认该文件已不再需要。**不要删除个人 目录中已有的 "
"``.bashrc``、``.bash_profile``、``log.*.out`` 等系统 或作业日志文件**，避免影响应用与作业运行。"
msgstr ""
"Deletion cannot be undone. Confirm the file is no longer needed before deleting. **Do not delete existing system or job log files in your personal directory such as ``.bashrc``, ``.bash_profile``, or ``log.*.out``**, to avoid affecting applications and jobs."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:60 35ab0f18230f411bbfc8d541fc3a144d
msgid "在文件列表中找到需要删除的文件。"
msgstr "Find the file to delete in the file list."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:61 7ca4fdba6c134db68fc0a39f4d024687
msgid "点击该行最右侧的红色 ``×`` 按钮。"
msgstr "Click the red ``×`` button at the far right of that row."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:62 284af1b69f9040deb9db5c7eb2654ed3
msgid "在确认对话框中点击 ``确定``，完成删除。"
msgstr "Click ``OK`` in the confirmation dialog to complete deletion."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:65 426d823c9cc642f3b54b2bba1f5138cb
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:67 bfa98f7ddee04f2fa5c269896bfc600a
msgid ""
"**文件上传失败怎么办？** 检查网络连接是否正常，确认文件大小未超过平台限制；如反复失败，请 提交工单并附上文件大小、扩展名和失败提示截图。"
msgstr ""
"**What if file upload fails?** Check your network connection and confirm the file size is within platform limits. If failures persist, submit a ticket with the file size, extension, and a screenshot of the error."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:71 66cfaed755084cde9f4e997fdf2daadc
msgid "**找不到上传的文件怎么办？** 检查页面顶部的当前路径是否正确；使用工具栏的 ``搜索文件`` 输入关键 字检索。"
msgstr "**What if I cannot find an uploaded file?** Verify the current path at the top of the page; use ``Search Files`` in the toolbar to search by keyword."

#: ../../docs/data/files.rst:75 e7d5678880f645a399c4590802f9bec9
msgid "**删除后是否可恢复？** 不可恢复，请删除前再次确认。"
msgstr "**Can deleted files be recovered?** No. Confirm again before deleting."
